# Local tooling state (branch context stays private, harness assets are tracked)
!.opencode/
.opencode/*
!.opencode/agents/**/*.md
!.opencode/commands/**/*.md
!.opencode/skills/**/*.md
!.opencode/skills/**/*.py
!.opencode/skills/**/*.sh
